  m_text: '<b>Welcome aboard.</b> This is a live view of the EOSAT-1 satellite simulator.


    <color=#7D8896>HUB</color>   The globe shows where the satellite is. Panels give its position and ground track.

    <color=#7D8896>SPACE</color>   Fly alongside the satellite and look at it from the Sun, Earth and more.'
